              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Steven C Davis"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I added capers to the dill garnish at the end. Adds a nice look and a bit of zing to the flavor.\nLike others, I also topped with Hollandaise Sauce.\nWithout, it's not (Eggs) Benedict.",
